    "summary": "The Allies won. Emperor Hirohito announced Japan's surrender on 15 August 1945, the instrument of surrender was signed on 2 September and the China Expeditionary Army surrendered at Nanjing on 9 September. Japan was occupied under MacArthur; Taiwan returned to China, Korea was divided at the 38th parallel, and the Soviet Union took southern Sakhalin and the Kurils. The war in Asia and the Pacific killed well over 20 million people, the great majority of them Chinese civilians.",
